1
00:01:27,105 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:35,185 --> 00:01:36,025
Father.

3
00:01:36,105 --> 00:01:37,465
Even if I say it ten thousand times,

4
00:01:38,105 --> 00:01:39,785
I will still be with Teacher.

5
00:01:39,865 --> 00:01:41,225
Our love is sincere.

6
00:01:41,305 --> 00:01:42,825
The Shen family has upheld
integrity for generations.

7
00:01:42,905 --> 00:01:43,985
We have built our name on moral principle.

8
00:01:44,065 --> 00:01:45,785
I taught you the classics and propriety

9
00:01:45,865 --> 00:01:48,905
not so you could defy human bonds.

10
00:01:48,985 --> 00:01:50,505
That fine teacher of yours—

11
00:01:50,585 --> 00:01:52,505
if he truly cared for you at all,

12
00:01:52,585 --> 00:01:54,945
why would he personally

13
00:01:55,025 --> 00:01:56,345
push you toward the
Empress's throne at court?

14
00:01:56,425 --> 00:01:58,185
Teacher must have his reasons.

15
00:01:58,265 --> 00:01:59,505
He said

16
00:01:59,585 --> 00:02:02,025
even if condemned by
all and cursed by fate,

17
00:02:02,105 --> 00:02:04,945
-he would still take my hand for life.
-Come to your senses.

18
00:02:05,025 --> 00:02:05,945
Husband.

19
00:02:06,025 --> 00:02:06,865
Sister Zhili.

20
00:02:11,985 --> 00:02:13,105
In all these years,

21
00:02:15,425 --> 00:02:17,545
this is the first time Father has hit me.

22
00:02:19,345 --> 00:02:21,305
Husband. Zhili.

23
00:02:21,385 --> 00:02:23,265
Both of you, calm down.

24
00:02:24,465 --> 00:02:25,345
Zhili.

25
00:02:26,225 --> 00:02:28,065
Your father has devoted himself to you.

26
00:02:28,145 --> 00:02:29,865
When has he ever acted selfishly?

27
00:02:30,905 --> 00:02:32,585
He fears one wrong step

28
00:02:32,665 --> 00:02:34,065
will leave you regretting it for life.

29
00:02:37,145 --> 00:02:37,985
Mother.

30
00:02:38,065 --> 00:02:40,105
If no one cares what I want,

31
00:02:40,185 --> 00:02:42,185
then I can only decide for myself.

32
00:02:42,265 --> 00:02:44,305
I'm going to the palace to see His
Majesty.

33
00:02:44,385 --> 00:02:46,185
-His Majesty will know what to do.
-Stop her.

34
00:02:46,265 --> 00:02:47,665
-Sister Zhili.
-Stop that unfilial girl!

35
00:02:47,745 --> 00:02:49,105
Until the ancestral ceremony,

36
00:02:49,185 --> 00:02:51,385
you are not to leave this room.

37
00:02:51,465 --> 00:02:52,305
Move.

38
00:02:54,425 --> 00:02:55,265
Sister.

39
00:02:56,025 --> 00:02:57,065
If you walk out that door,

40
00:02:57,145 --> 00:02:59,185
you'll put the Shen family in grave
danger.

41
00:02:59,265 --> 00:03:01,065
I won't let you become a sinner for the
ages.

42
00:03:02,985 --> 00:03:04,025
I thought

43
00:03:04,105 --> 00:03:07,185
only Zhili was fit to stand beside His
Majesty.

44
00:03:07,265 --> 00:03:08,745
I even invoked the Royal Command Tally

45
00:03:08,825 --> 00:03:09,705
to force His Majesty's hand.

46
00:03:10,585 --> 00:03:11,745
I never imagined...

47
00:03:12,385 --> 00:03:14,425
How can I face His Majesty now?

48
00:03:15,705 --> 00:03:18,545
Or the ancestors of the Shen family?

49
00:03:25,425 --> 00:03:27,065
After checking through multiple sources,

50
00:03:27,145 --> 00:03:29,465
This cross clearly points
to the character "Gu."

51
00:03:29,545 --> 00:03:31,105
Doukou can testify

52
00:03:31,185 --> 00:03:32,545
that Gu Qin killed his wife and father,

53
00:03:33,585 --> 00:03:35,665
but we still lack solid proof

54
00:03:35,745 --> 00:03:36,785
that he colluded with Ling Yunfei.

55
00:03:36,865 --> 00:03:38,385
Justice has a way of revealing itself.

56
00:03:39,825 --> 00:03:41,585
While Di Nian and I were
hunting down the Blood Moon Society,

57
00:03:41,665 --> 00:03:42,825
we made an unexpected discovery.

58
00:03:44,105 --> 00:03:45,745
Tomorrow happens to be Gu Qin's birthday.

59
00:03:46,345 --> 00:03:48,465
Let's give him a grand gift together.

60
00:03:51,905 --> 00:03:52,745
And one more thing.

61
00:03:53,825 --> 00:03:55,145
Once he confesses and faces punishment,

62
00:03:55,945 --> 00:03:57,945
I will immediately settle
the matter of appointing an Empress.

63
00:03:59,025 --> 00:03:59,865
Your Majesty.

64
00:04:01,265 --> 00:04:02,545
There is one thing
I still do not understand.

65
00:04:03,225 --> 00:04:06,305
Grand Tutor Shen has always
understood Your Majesty best,

66
00:04:06,385 --> 00:04:08,385
and has always let Zhili
make her own choices.

67
00:04:09,065 --> 00:04:10,145
Why, then, would the Grand Tutor

68
00:04:10,225 --> 00:04:12,225
insist on making Zhili Empress?

69
00:04:12,865 --> 00:04:13,865
And that day,

70
00:04:14,545 --> 00:04:15,665
outside the imperial study,

71
00:04:17,465 --> 00:04:19,865
I saw the struggle in Your Majesty's eyes.

72
00:04:20,745 --> 00:04:22,505
Was it also because of
something the Grand Tutor said?

73
00:04:26,265 --> 00:04:27,105
Rest assured.

74
00:04:27,705 --> 00:04:30,985
I have never wavered in my feelings for
you.

75
00:04:31,785 --> 00:04:33,585
No matter what happens from now on,

76
00:04:33,665 --> 00:04:36,825
I will clear every obstacle
from your path beforehand.

77
00:04:40,585 --> 00:04:41,425
Your Majesty.

78
00:04:42,705 --> 00:04:44,065
What I have sought all my life

79
00:04:45,265 --> 00:04:46,865
was never a phoenix crown
and bridal robes,

80
00:04:46,945 --> 00:04:49,145
but a position of real authority.

81
00:04:49,945 --> 00:04:52,065
When Zhili was nominated as Empress

82
00:04:52,145 --> 00:04:53,665
and had to leave
the Office of Public Inquiry,

83
00:04:54,785 --> 00:04:56,065
it pained me.

84
00:04:56,865 --> 00:04:58,625
Once I am named Empress,

85
00:04:58,705 --> 00:05:00,345
I can no longer live on my own terms.

86
00:05:00,425 --> 00:05:03,265
All my life's ambitions
would come to nothing.

87
00:05:04,025 --> 00:05:06,505
I trust Your Majesty
to weigh everything carefully.

88
00:05:06,585 --> 00:05:07,985
But opposing both Chancellors,

89
00:05:08,465 --> 00:05:09,545
holding the ministers in check,

90
00:05:10,025 --> 00:05:11,625
and finding a way
to answer the Grand Tutor...

91
00:05:11,705 --> 00:05:13,705
the path of an emperor is too difficult.

92
00:05:14,865 --> 00:05:16,625
Perhaps we should take one step back

93
00:05:17,665 --> 00:05:19,505
and return to being sovereign and subject.

94
00:05:19,585 --> 00:05:20,905
For Your Majesty,

95
00:05:21,545 --> 00:05:22,665
and for me,

96
00:05:23,985 --> 00:05:26,665
perhaps that is the best outcome for now.

97
00:05:28,145 --> 00:05:29,105
Difficult...

98
00:05:29,825 --> 00:05:31,185
Does being difficult mean
we simply give up?

99
00:05:31,865 --> 00:05:33,145
That does not sound like you.

100
00:05:33,825 --> 00:05:35,065
Nor does it sound like me.

101
00:05:35,145 --> 00:05:36,585
I told you,

102
00:05:37,745 --> 00:05:39,825
I want you beside me
through every season and festival.

103
00:05:40,985 --> 00:05:42,345
Every promise I have made to you,

104
00:05:44,505 --> 00:05:46,025
I will keep.

105
00:06:10,585 --> 00:06:13,025
Are you Mo Yuhan
of the Blood Moon Society?

106
00:06:13,105 --> 00:06:13,945
I am.

107
00:06:14,985 --> 00:06:16,545
I am Zhao Hui, envoy of Beijian.

108
00:06:16,625 --> 00:06:17,865
By order of my sovereign,

109
00:06:17,945 --> 00:06:19,265
I have come to discuss
a great undertaking with you.

110
00:06:26,505 --> 00:06:27,385
Tell your sovereign

111
00:06:28,105 --> 00:06:29,025
the Blood Moon Society

112
00:06:29,545 --> 00:06:30,705
has no welcome for Beijian.

113
00:06:51,825 --> 00:06:52,745
Who are you really?

114
00:06:53,385 --> 00:06:55,745
How dare you impersonate me
and kill Beijian's envoy,

115
00:06:55,825 --> 00:06:57,385
then frame the Blood Moon Society?

116
00:07:07,425 --> 00:07:08,825
Shen Zhishu.

117
00:07:09,425 --> 00:07:10,385
You people...

118
00:07:10,985 --> 00:07:12,225
think you can restore your kingdom?

119
00:07:12,945 --> 00:07:13,785
Kill them.

120
00:07:14,665 --> 00:07:16,105
Leave no one alive.

121
00:08:41,145 --> 00:08:42,865
Ying Gua's lackeys.

122
00:08:42,945 --> 00:08:44,505
You're nothing special.

123
00:09:26,025 --> 00:09:27,305
Second Young Master.

124
00:09:45,465 --> 00:09:46,905
The foolish thing anyone can do

125
00:09:47,505 --> 00:09:48,865
is starve themselves.

126
00:09:48,945 --> 00:09:50,105
It only hurts

127
00:09:50,185 --> 00:09:51,745
the people who care about you most.

128
00:09:52,465 --> 00:09:54,665
Father made your favorite
sweet-and-sour ribs.

129
00:09:55,425 --> 00:09:56,345
Have a bite.

130
00:09:56,985 --> 00:09:59,425
You all keep saying you care about me,

131
00:09:59,505 --> 00:10:01,145
but has anyone asked

132
00:10:03,185 --> 00:10:04,865
how much this hurts me?

133
00:10:07,905 --> 00:10:09,705
Then put your hand over your heart

134
00:10:09,785 --> 00:10:10,625
and ask yourself

135
00:10:10,705 --> 00:10:12,705
whether you have even
the slightest doubt.

136
00:10:13,345 --> 00:10:14,425
And Doukou already...

137
00:10:14,505 --> 00:10:15,505
Enough.

138
00:10:16,465 --> 00:10:18,345
Unless I see it with my own eyes

139
00:10:18,425 --> 00:10:19,465
and hear it with my own ears,

140
00:10:24,465 --> 00:10:25,305
Zhili.

141
00:10:27,705 --> 00:10:29,625
You may distrust anyone in this world,

142
00:10:31,345 --> 00:10:32,465
but could you

143
00:10:32,545 --> 00:10:33,465
trust me just this once?

144
00:10:35,425 --> 00:10:37,945
No one wants your happiness more than I
do.

145
00:10:43,825 --> 00:10:45,065
Anian.

146
00:10:46,985 --> 00:10:48,145
Then help me.

147
00:10:49,425 --> 00:10:50,425
Let me see him.

148
00:10:51,305 --> 00:10:52,625
I want to hear him say it himself.

149
00:10:52,705 --> 00:10:55,265
If he has betrayed me,
I will give up on him.

150
00:11:00,945 --> 00:11:02,465
I'd rather you hate me now

151
00:11:06,665 --> 00:11:08,145
than stand by

152
00:11:08,625 --> 00:11:10,745
and watch you leap off a cliff.

153
00:11:20,065 --> 00:11:21,105
Anian.

154
00:11:23,105 --> 00:11:24,545
The bitterest thing in this world

155
00:11:25,465 --> 00:11:26,585
is not love or hatred,

156
00:11:27,545 --> 00:11:28,785
but regret.

157
00:11:42,345 --> 00:11:44,505
Today, I prepared this banquet

158
00:11:44,585 --> 00:11:45,545
according to the honors due a prince.

159
00:11:45,625 --> 00:11:47,945
Only that befits the Right Chancellor's
merit.

160
00:11:48,705 --> 00:11:50,025
This first cup

161
00:11:50,105 --> 00:11:51,065
is to your birthday.

162
00:11:54,225 --> 00:11:55,945
Your Majesty has shown me
unprecedented favor.

163
00:11:56,025 --> 00:11:56,985
Such grace has never been seen
in our dynasty.

164
00:11:57,065 --> 00:11:58,385
I will remember it with gratitude.

165
00:11:58,465 --> 00:11:59,745
My life is fulfilled.

166
00:12:02,585 --> 00:12:03,465
Congratulations, Right Chancellor.

167
00:12:03,545 --> 00:12:05,945
I have also prepared a modest gift.

168
00:12:06,025 --> 00:12:07,225
It will be presented
at the auspicious hour.

169
00:12:07,825 --> 00:12:09,265
Please wait a little longer.

170
00:12:09,345 --> 00:12:10,825
How thoughtful of you, Director Meng.

171
00:12:11,345 --> 00:12:12,185
As a woman,

172
00:12:12,265 --> 00:12:13,665
to hold the post of Director

173
00:12:13,745 --> 00:12:14,865
is rare enough.

174
00:12:14,945 --> 00:12:16,625
Yet you still observe
every courtesy so carefully.

175
00:12:17,145 --> 00:12:18,585
The younger generation
is truly formidable.

176
00:12:22,305 --> 00:12:24,545
-Congratulations, Right Chancellor.
-Congratulations, Right Chancellor.

177
00:12:35,225 --> 00:12:36,345
Attendants.

178
00:12:38,705 --> 00:12:40,625
This is the birthday gift
I prepared for the Right Chancellor.

179
00:12:40,705 --> 00:12:42,065
I trust

180
00:12:42,745 --> 00:12:43,865
it will not disappoint you.

181
00:12:54,785 --> 00:12:56,145
Thank you for Your Majesty's great favor.

182
00:13:05,625 --> 00:13:06,865
Record of Loyal Ministers.

183
00:13:12,185 --> 00:13:13,265
Your Majesty.

184
00:13:27,825 --> 00:13:29,305
I have an urgent matter to report.

185
00:13:29,385 --> 00:13:30,305
Your Majesty.

186
00:13:31,265 --> 00:13:32,665
I should not have interrupted,

187
00:13:33,425 --> 00:13:34,825
but the Empress installation
ceremony is near.

188
00:13:35,865 --> 00:13:37,385
If I do not speak today,

189
00:13:37,465 --> 00:13:38,625
there will be no chance to turn back.

190
00:13:39,265 --> 00:13:40,225
Rise and speak.

191
00:13:48,785 --> 00:13:49,665
Teacher.

192
00:13:51,905 --> 00:13:53,785
That day, you gave me the Heart-Lock

193
00:13:54,265 --> 00:13:55,505
and promised we could live
as ordinary people.

194
00:13:55,585 --> 00:13:57,145
You asked whether I was willing

195
00:13:57,225 --> 00:13:58,545
to be brave for you once more.

196
00:13:59,625 --> 00:14:00,825
Today, I want to ask:

197
00:14:01,465 --> 00:14:03,905
does that promise still stand?

198
00:14:13,665 --> 00:14:14,665
Your Majesty.

199
00:14:15,305 --> 00:14:16,385
I am guilty.

200
00:14:16,465 --> 00:14:18,345
I failed in my teaching

201
00:14:18,425 --> 00:14:19,625
and caused Zhili to confuse

202
00:14:19,705 --> 00:14:21,865
the bond between teacher and student
with love between a man and woman.

203
00:14:22,745 --> 00:14:24,665
But this Heart-Lock
and promise of a common life

204
00:14:24,745 --> 00:14:26,345
are entirely fabricated.

205
00:14:33,145 --> 00:14:34,985
Entirely fabricated?

206
00:14:35,065 --> 00:14:37,345
Then were all the promises
you made me before

207
00:14:38,345 --> 00:14:40,505
nothing but lies?

208
00:14:42,585 --> 00:14:43,425
Zhili.

209
00:14:44,585 --> 00:14:45,785
You have disappointed me deeply.

210
00:14:45,865 --> 00:14:48,225
Who has bewitched you

211
00:14:48,785 --> 00:14:50,585
into inventing such treasonous lies?

212
00:14:57,025 --> 00:14:58,265
This Heart-Lock

213
00:14:59,265 --> 00:15:01,105
was given to me by your own hand.

214
00:15:01,185 --> 00:15:02,625
You carved it yourself.

215
00:15:02,705 --> 00:15:05,465
Must we find someone
to verify your handwriting too?

216
00:15:10,745 --> 00:15:12,265
You trample on true feelings

217
00:15:13,225 --> 00:15:14,665
and built your reputation on lies.

218
00:15:16,665 --> 00:15:17,825
From this day forward,

219
00:15:19,425 --> 00:15:20,545
I, Shen Zhili,

220
00:15:21,705 --> 00:15:23,065
sever all ties

221
00:15:23,985 --> 00:15:25,625
with you, Gu Qin.

222
00:15:34,185 --> 00:15:35,025
Right Chancellor.

223
00:15:35,945 --> 00:15:37,585
If you loved Shen Zhili,

224
00:15:37,665 --> 00:15:39,545
why did you recommend her as Empress?

225
00:15:39,625 --> 00:15:41,545
What exactly were you trying to do?

226
00:15:43,825 --> 00:15:46,145
Your Majesty, I have been wronged!

227
00:15:46,225 --> 00:15:48,305
Someone must resent
my position as Chancellor

228
00:15:48,385 --> 00:15:50,185
and have manipulated Zhili
into framing me

229
00:15:50,265 --> 00:15:51,585
so they could put me to death.

230
00:15:51,665 --> 00:15:54,025
You call yourself
a virtuous Chancellor of Daning.

231
00:15:54,105 --> 00:15:56,145
Then let this golden register
tell you today

232
00:15:56,225 --> 00:15:58,105
which deeds history cannot hide.

233
00:15:58,185 --> 00:15:59,305
Open it.

234
00:16:10,465 --> 00:16:12,545
It's fake. Every word is fake!

235
00:16:12,625 --> 00:16:14,385
Truth and falsehood

236
00:16:14,465 --> 00:16:15,865
are not yours to argue away.

237
00:16:15,945 --> 00:16:17,785
My gift for you has arrived as well.

238
00:16:23,065 --> 00:16:24,225
Your Majesty, please see the truth.

239
00:16:24,305 --> 00:16:25,665
I am Doukou,

240
00:16:25,745 --> 00:16:27,585
Madam Yuan's dowry maid.

241
00:16:27,665 --> 00:16:28,945
I heard with my own ears

242
00:16:29,025 --> 00:16:30,905
the Right Chancellor confess
his feelings to Miss Shen.

243
00:16:30,985 --> 00:16:32,825
And I saw with my own eyes

244
00:16:32,905 --> 00:16:34,065
that it was he

245
00:16:34,145 --> 00:16:35,385
who stabbed her once,

246
00:16:37,025 --> 00:16:39,265
then again, killing my mistress.

247
00:16:39,945 --> 00:16:40,865
Poor Madam

248
00:16:40,945 --> 00:16:42,305
was already one month pregnant,

249
00:16:42,385 --> 00:16:43,665
yet he still...

250
00:16:43,745 --> 00:16:45,545
still had the heart to kill her.

251
00:16:45,625 --> 00:16:46,585
Wretched maid!

252
00:16:46,665 --> 00:16:48,065
Every word is a lie!

253
00:16:50,505 --> 00:16:51,745
Guards!

254
00:16:54,905 --> 00:16:56,545
I am Xue Leng, a condemned criminal,

255
00:16:56,625 --> 00:16:58,745
an assassin kept
by the Right Chancellor.

256
00:16:58,825 --> 00:17:00,305
All these years,

257
00:17:00,385 --> 00:17:02,665
he threatened the lives
of my wife and daughter

258
00:17:02,745 --> 00:17:04,825
and forced me
to carry out assassinations.

259
00:17:04,905 --> 00:17:06,185
At his orders,

260
00:17:06,265 --> 00:17:07,225
I killed Wan Kai with my own hands.

261
00:17:07,305 --> 00:17:09,305
But I did not kill Liu Ruyan.

262
00:17:09,985 --> 00:17:11,625
He killed her himself.

263
00:17:12,585 --> 00:17:13,625
The Right Chancellor

264
00:17:13,705 --> 00:17:16,425
has colluded with Ling Yunfei for years.

265
00:17:16,505 --> 00:17:17,665
You vile slave!

266
00:17:17,745 --> 00:17:18,825
How dare you slander me!

267
00:17:18,905 --> 00:17:20,665
I would never collude
with a bandit chieftain.

268
00:17:22,145 --> 00:17:23,185
Do you all know

269
00:17:23,865 --> 00:17:25,585
why Ling Yunfei
could evade the law for so long?

270
00:17:25,665 --> 00:17:28,265
Because the greatest protector behind him

271
00:17:29,265 --> 00:17:31,825
was none other than Gu Qin,
Daning's virtuous Chancellor.

272
00:17:32,545 --> 00:17:34,705
Ling Yunfei is his younger half brother,

273
00:17:34,785 --> 00:17:36,585
who grew up outside the family.

274
00:17:38,105 --> 00:17:40,145
Meng Tinghui, you are framing me!

275
00:17:47,745 --> 00:17:49,265
Gu Qin.

276
00:17:49,345 --> 00:17:50,825
You abused your authority

277
00:17:50,905 --> 00:17:51,825
to erase his household registration,

278
00:17:51,905 --> 00:17:54,425
turning Ling Yunfei
into a man who could not exist openly.

279
00:17:54,505 --> 00:17:55,745
It was also you

280
00:17:55,825 --> 00:17:57,305
who had Ling Yunfei kill Chancellor Yuan

281
00:17:57,385 --> 00:17:59,105
so you could claim all the credit
for controlling the floods

282
00:17:59,185 --> 00:18:00,145
and rise to the chancellorship.

283
00:18:00,225 --> 00:18:01,185
And it was still you

284
00:18:02,185 --> 00:18:03,865
who ordered Ling Yunfei

285
00:18:03,945 --> 00:18:06,505
to use gambling dens and female students
to control the ministers,

286
00:18:06,585 --> 00:18:07,825
and planted women from Wanxiang House

287
00:18:07,905 --> 00:18:10,505
in your colleagues' homes as spies.

288
00:18:10,585 --> 00:18:12,505
That official cap on your head

289
00:18:12,585 --> 00:18:15,345
is soaked in your father-in-law's blood,
your brother's soul,

290
00:18:15,425 --> 00:18:16,345
and the lives of your wife and child.

291
00:18:17,145 --> 00:18:18,785
Can you still wear it with a clear
conscience?

292
00:18:23,025 --> 00:18:24,185
Take them away.

293
00:18:34,545 --> 00:18:35,425
Gu Qin.

294
00:18:36,425 --> 00:18:37,745
The evidence is conclusive.

295
00:18:38,545 --> 00:18:39,385
It is time to confess.

296
00:18:51,865 --> 00:18:52,705
Confess?

297
00:18:55,225 --> 00:18:56,185
Why should I?

298
00:18:58,145 --> 00:18:59,585
Chancellor Yuan only knew
how to sit in his room

299
00:18:59,665 --> 00:19:01,145
and write elegant policy essays.

300
00:19:01,225 --> 00:19:02,505
With one circle of his vermilion brush,

301
00:19:02,585 --> 00:19:03,865
he took all the glory.

302
00:19:03,945 --> 00:19:05,065
Why?

303
00:19:05,705 --> 00:19:06,905
Yes, I killed Chancellor Yuan.

304
00:19:08,185 --> 00:19:09,105
But I traded one man's life

305
00:19:09,185 --> 00:19:10,985
for ten years of peace
for the people of seven prefectures.

306
00:19:11,065 --> 00:19:12,305
Was that not worth it?

307
00:19:12,385 --> 00:19:13,945
Among all the high officials at court,

308
00:19:14,025 --> 00:19:16,105
whose hands are not stained
with a colleague's blood?

309
00:19:16,185 --> 00:19:17,585
Why should I, Gu Qin, confess?

310
00:19:17,665 --> 00:19:19,345
The peace of those seven prefectures

311
00:19:19,425 --> 00:19:21,305
was won by hundreds of thousands
of soldiers and civilians.

312
00:19:21,745 --> 00:19:23,865
How dare you steal their merit for
yourself?

313
00:19:23,945 --> 00:19:25,425
Gu Qin.

314
00:19:25,505 --> 00:19:27,585
You keep claiming
everything was for the people,

315
00:19:27,665 --> 00:19:30,665
but their peace was never in your heart.

316
00:19:30,745 --> 00:19:32,545
You wanted to use other people's bones

317
00:19:33,225 --> 00:19:34,745
to pave your road to power.

318
00:19:34,825 --> 00:19:35,825
Meng Tinghui.

319
00:19:36,505 --> 00:19:38,745
You are noble. You are remarkable.

320
00:19:38,825 --> 00:19:40,185
Everyone loves you, Meng Tinghui.

321
00:19:40,785 --> 00:19:42,185
Now you can stand above me

322
00:19:42,265 --> 00:19:44,745
and condemn me, despise me.

323
00:19:46,865 --> 00:19:48,225
But who knows

324
00:19:48,305 --> 00:19:49,745
how hard this road has been for me?

325
00:19:49,825 --> 00:19:51,865
I was born poor,
without power or influence.

326
00:19:52,905 --> 00:19:54,705
Anyone could trample over me.

327
00:19:54,785 --> 00:19:56,265
In the late Emperor's eyes,

328
00:19:56,345 --> 00:19:58,825
there were only Chancellor Yuan, Xu Ting,

329
00:19:58,905 --> 00:20:00,585
Shen Wuchen and those old ministers.

330
00:20:01,185 --> 00:20:02,785
I endured for ten years

331
00:20:02,865 --> 00:20:04,705
until His Majesty finally took the throne.

332
00:20:05,505 --> 00:20:08,305
But now you purge old ministers
and promote newcomers.

333
00:20:08,385 --> 00:20:11,265
Now even a woman
wants to climb over my head.

334
00:20:11,345 --> 00:20:12,745
If I do not kill everyone in my way,

335
00:20:12,825 --> 00:20:13,705
what else am I supposed to do?

336
00:20:13,785 --> 00:20:16,145
You are hardly the only official
born to a humble family.

337
00:20:17,065 --> 00:20:20,665
You blame your greed,
ambition, and cruelty

338
00:20:20,745 --> 00:20:22,785
on everyone else and on the world itself.

339
00:20:23,905 --> 00:20:24,745
Fine.

340
00:20:25,545 --> 00:20:27,305
Today I will let all Daning

341
00:20:27,385 --> 00:20:29,065
see exactly how vile and contemptible you
are.

342
00:20:35,425 --> 00:20:36,265
Yes.

343
00:20:38,865 --> 00:20:39,865
I am vile.

344
00:20:41,145 --> 00:20:41,985
Contemptible.

345
00:20:43,785 --> 00:20:46,065
All my life, I, Gu Qin,
have wanted only to rise.

346
00:20:47,025 --> 00:20:48,825
Step by step,

347
00:20:48,905 --> 00:20:51,745
higher and higher,

348
00:20:51,825 --> 00:20:54,305
until I reached
the highest halls of power.

349
00:20:54,385 --> 00:20:55,945
I wanted to become the mighty minister

350
00:20:56,025 --> 00:20:57,305
below only one man
and above everyone else.

351
00:21:00,865 --> 00:21:02,705
For that one day,

352
00:21:02,785 --> 00:21:04,185
I endured all these years

353
00:21:05,745 --> 00:21:07,225
and killed so many people.

354
00:21:08,305 --> 00:21:10,905
Why could none of you
simply let me have it?

355
00:21:10,985 --> 00:21:13,385
How could you think something so absurd?

356
00:21:14,105 --> 00:21:15,825
How could you turn
a lifetime of resentment

357
00:21:15,905 --> 00:21:17,505
into a reason to draw your blade on
others?

358
00:21:17,585 --> 00:21:18,545
You vile woman!

359
00:21:20,905 --> 00:21:22,585
Even you look down on me.

360
00:21:24,345 --> 00:21:25,865
You're just like Yuan Lingyi.

361
00:21:26,585 --> 00:21:29,585
using your family name
to stand above me and condemn me.

362
00:21:34,825 --> 00:21:36,225
What imperial grace?

363
00:21:37,305 --> 00:21:38,905
What Zhangde Palace banquet?

364
00:21:39,625 --> 00:21:40,785
From beginning to end,

365
00:21:40,865 --> 00:21:42,705
His Majesty arranged all of it to destroy
me.

366
00:21:44,985 --> 00:21:47,025
I, Gu Qin, have been loyal all my life.

367
00:21:49,745 --> 00:21:51,145
Daning is the one that failed me!

368
00:21:51,225 --> 00:21:53,185
You still dare speak of loyalty?

369
00:21:57,865 --> 00:22:00,265
Power has blinded you.

370
00:22:01,225 --> 00:22:02,545
You colluded with the Blood Moon Society

371
00:22:02,625 --> 00:22:04,025
and leaked the border defenses.

372
00:22:04,105 --> 00:22:05,265
You betrayed Daning long ago.

373
00:22:07,825 --> 00:22:09,345
Gu Qin, Right Chancellor of Daning,

374
00:22:10,145 --> 00:22:11,385
your crimes are proven beyond doubt.

375
00:22:12,145 --> 00:22:14,265
You are stripped of all rank and office

376
00:22:14,345 --> 00:22:15,505
and your three clans are to be
exterminated.

377
00:22:16,105 --> 00:22:17,945
Publish his crimes throughout the realm

378
00:22:19,065 --> 00:22:20,625
as a warning to all.

379
00:22:20,705 --> 00:22:21,545
Take him away.

380
00:22:27,425 --> 00:22:30,425
Meng Tinghui, I'll drag you down with me
today!

381
00:22:36,505 --> 00:22:37,945
You forced me to this!

382
00:22:38,025 --> 00:22:39,105
I'm innocent!

383
00:22:39,185 --> 00:22:40,665
I'm a flood-control hero!

384
00:22:40,745 --> 00:22:42,945
-You forced me!
-Gu Qin!

385
00:22:43,025 --> 00:22:44,665
The court's judgment

386
00:22:44,745 --> 00:22:45,745
is not the end of your reckoning.

387
00:22:47,145 --> 00:22:48,665
As Daning's so-called virtuous Chancellor,

388
00:22:49,905 --> 00:22:51,585
you should face the people's judgment.

389
00:22:51,665 --> 00:22:52,745
I'm innocent!

390
00:22:52,825 --> 00:22:54,985
Your Majesty, I'm a flood-control hero!

391
00:22:55,065 --> 00:22:56,225
I'm innocent!

392
00:22:56,305 --> 00:22:57,785
Take him away.

393
00:22:57,865 --> 00:22:58,785
I'm innocent!

394
00:22:58,865 --> 00:23:00,945
I'm the flood-control hero!

395
00:23:01,025 --> 00:23:02,225
Let go of me!

396
00:23:02,305 --> 00:23:04,025
I'm the flood-control hero!

397
00:23:29,025 --> 00:23:30,065
Zhili.

398
00:23:30,145 --> 00:23:31,425
You were very brave.

399
00:23:31,505 --> 00:23:32,705
If you need to cry, then cry.

400
00:23:32,785 --> 00:23:33,985
Mengmeng.

401
00:23:35,665 --> 00:23:37,585
Whenever I close my eyes now,

402
00:23:37,665 --> 00:23:40,225
I see him giving me the Heart-Lock,

403
00:23:41,265 --> 00:23:43,345
looking so gentle.

404
00:23:47,025 --> 00:23:49,585
It was all part of a trap he carefully
designed.

405
00:23:49,665 --> 00:23:50,625
I hate him.

406
00:23:51,785 --> 00:23:53,865
But I hate myself even more.

407
00:23:53,945 --> 00:23:56,345
He was wrong, not you.

408
00:23:56,425 --> 00:23:58,625
What you did today took extraordinary
courage.

409
00:23:58,705 --> 00:24:00,625
How many people could have done the same?

410
00:24:07,345 --> 00:24:08,705
You can begin again.

411
00:24:09,865 --> 00:24:10,705
Zhili.

412
00:24:10,785 --> 00:24:11,865
Your battlefield

413
00:24:12,425 --> 00:24:14,065
is not only in matters of the heart.

414
00:24:14,145 --> 00:24:15,185
It is also at the Office of Public
Inquiry,

415
00:24:15,265 --> 00:24:16,825
in case files and official records,

416
00:24:17,465 --> 00:24:18,905
and among the people of Daning.

417
00:24:19,785 --> 00:24:21,065
I'll be there with you.

418
00:24:34,105 --> 00:24:35,785
It's cold. Don't catch a chill.

419
00:24:40,705 --> 00:24:41,785
I want to walk by myself.

420
00:25:51,225 --> 00:25:53,985
I am Daning's greatest Chancellor.

421
00:25:56,065 --> 00:25:57,305
I controlled the floods,

422
00:25:57,385 --> 00:25:58,425
put down rebellions,

423
00:25:58,905 --> 00:26:00,345
and opened canals.

424
00:26:01,505 --> 00:26:03,545
I created this age of prosperity myself.

425
00:26:06,585 --> 00:26:07,905
Meng Tinghui.

426
00:26:08,545 --> 00:26:09,385
Look.

427
00:26:10,465 --> 00:26:11,305
The people...

428
00:26:12,345 --> 00:26:14,425
Look how they adore me.

429
00:26:15,105 --> 00:26:16,785
Meng Tinghui, look.

430
00:26:17,745 --> 00:26:18,625
The people...

431
00:26:20,145 --> 00:26:21,905
Look how they adore me.

432
00:26:23,345 --> 00:26:25,065
All of you must remember me.

433
00:26:25,705 --> 00:26:27,865
I am Daning's greatest Chancellor.

434
00:26:27,945 --> 00:26:32,465
Gu Qin.

435
00:26:47,305 --> 00:26:49,985
I am Gu Qin, Daning's greatest Chancellor!

436
00:26:52,585 --> 00:26:55,185
You should all revere me!

437
00:26:56,745 --> 00:26:58,825
The hero who controlled the floods!

438
00:26:59,545 --> 00:27:02,185
I am Gu Qin, the flood-control hero!

439
00:27:06,385 --> 00:27:07,945
The dike has burst!

440
00:27:08,025 --> 00:27:09,065
The dike has burst!

441
00:27:09,145 --> 00:27:10,585
Hurry!

442
00:27:10,665 --> 00:27:12,345
People are dying! Hurry!

443
00:27:12,945 --> 00:27:14,425
Come with me to fight the flood!

444
00:27:25,425 --> 00:27:27,145
Quick, move the sandbags!

445
00:27:27,225 --> 00:27:28,185
Seal the breach!

446
00:27:28,265 --> 00:27:29,185
Hurry!

447
00:27:29,265 --> 00:27:30,705
Move the sandbags!

448
00:27:31,825 --> 00:27:32,945
With me, Gu Qin, here,

449
00:27:33,025 --> 00:27:34,545
the flood cannot hurt anyone!

450
00:27:36,585 --> 00:27:37,905
I'm the flood-control hero!

451
00:27:37,985 --> 00:27:39,625
I'm the flood-control hero!

452
00:27:42,625 --> 00:27:44,385
I'm the flood-control hero!

453
00:27:44,465 --> 00:27:45,305
I am...

454
00:28:39,585 --> 00:28:40,705
Chancellor.

455
00:28:40,785 --> 00:28:42,105
Gu Qin...

456
00:28:42,185 --> 00:28:43,465
is gone.

457
00:28:44,945 --> 00:28:46,505
He lost his mind

458
00:28:46,585 --> 00:28:47,825
and threw himself into the river.

459
00:28:49,185 --> 00:28:50,985
The man who controlled the floods

460
00:28:51,505 --> 00:28:52,985
ultimately died by water.

461
00:28:54,345 --> 00:28:56,705
Heaven's justice has come full circle.

462
00:28:56,785 --> 00:28:59,585
He was a Chancellor of the realm, after
all.

463
00:28:59,665 --> 00:29:01,585
Director Meng ordered

464
00:29:01,665 --> 00:29:03,265
the people's tribute umbrella burned in
the street.

465
00:29:03,345 --> 00:29:05,385
That only inflamed things further.

466
00:29:05,465 --> 00:29:07,385
The people are furious.

467
00:29:07,465 --> 00:29:09,305
They all watched his madness and disgrace.

468
00:29:09,385 --> 00:29:12,385
How long has Meng Tinghui served at court?

469
00:29:12,465 --> 00:29:14,985
More than three years, Chancellor.

470
00:29:15,065 --> 00:29:18,185
For these three years,
her methods have been extreme,

471
00:29:18,265 --> 00:29:19,785
stopping at nothing.

472
00:29:19,865 --> 00:29:21,745
The court and the realm are in turmoil,

473
00:29:21,825 --> 00:29:23,185
and the law has grown lax.

474
00:29:23,865 --> 00:29:26,265
Gu Qin deserved death ten thousand times
over,

475
00:29:26,345 --> 00:29:28,945
but some of what he said was true.

476
00:29:29,705 --> 00:29:32,905
Now newcomers hold sway in Daning,

477
00:29:32,985 --> 00:29:34,345
while veteran ministers have nowhere to
turn.

478
00:29:34,425 --> 00:29:36,785
I have served through three reigns.

479
00:29:37,985 --> 00:29:39,985
Yet when I look at the court today,

480
00:29:43,585 --> 00:29:46,065
it feels utterly unfamiliar.

481
00:30:03,105 --> 00:30:04,705
Grand Tutor,

482
00:30:04,785 --> 00:30:06,745
stop pretending not to hear.

483
00:30:07,505 --> 00:30:09,905
Zhili was once so celebrated.

484
00:30:09,985 --> 00:30:11,905
She was the prospective Empress.

485
00:30:11,985 --> 00:30:14,225
And now the whole capital knows

486
00:30:14,305 --> 00:30:15,465
she met the Right Chancellor
in secret at night

487
00:30:15,545 --> 00:30:17,945
and was entangled with her own teacher.

488
00:30:21,265 --> 00:30:22,225
Cousin,

489
00:30:22,305 --> 00:30:24,185
we are family.

490
00:30:24,265 --> 00:30:25,665
Naturally, I only want what's best for
Zhili.

491
00:30:25,745 --> 00:30:26,825
My nephew

492
00:30:27,505 --> 00:30:28,825
is about Zhili's age

493
00:30:28,905 --> 00:30:30,185
and is a scholar.

494
00:30:31,265 --> 00:30:33,225
His wife died two years ago,

495
00:30:33,305 --> 00:30:34,505
and he has not remarried.

496
00:30:34,585 --> 00:30:35,625
While he is still willing to marry her,

497
00:30:36,305 --> 00:30:37,745
why not let Zhili wed him?

498
00:30:37,825 --> 00:30:40,145
Zhili will never let idle gossip

499
00:30:40,225 --> 00:30:41,825
ruin her future.

500
00:30:41,905 --> 00:30:44,065
Her marriage is hers to decide.

501
00:30:44,145 --> 00:30:45,545
Even if she never marries,

502
00:30:45,625 --> 00:30:46,985
we will gladly care for her all her life.

503
00:30:47,065 --> 00:30:48,345
You needn't concern yourself.

504
00:30:49,705 --> 00:30:52,065
The tea is cold. Please leave.

505
00:30:56,945 --> 00:30:58,065
Grand Tutor,

506
00:30:58,825 --> 00:31:00,345
the Shen family today

507
00:31:00,425 --> 00:31:02,185
is not what it once was.

508
00:31:02,265 --> 00:31:03,985
The whole city is saying

509
00:31:04,065 --> 00:31:05,665
Zhili knew all along

510
00:31:05,745 --> 00:31:07,665
that the Chancellor murdered his wife and
child.

511
00:31:07,745 --> 00:31:09,185
Some even say she was his accomplice.

512
00:31:09,265 --> 00:31:10,185
If that were true,

513
00:31:10,265 --> 00:31:12,545
wouldn't your entire household
be executed?

514
00:31:13,865 --> 00:31:15,585
Gu Qin was a monster who killed his own
family.

515
00:31:15,665 --> 00:31:18,265
Zhili was the one who brought him to
justice.

516
00:31:18,345 --> 00:31:19,985
How does that make her an accomplice?

517
00:31:21,785 --> 00:31:23,305
If you dare spread such nonsense again,

518
00:31:23,385 --> 00:31:25,425
do not blame me for showing no courtesy.

519
00:31:25,505 --> 00:31:27,625
So much for my good intentions.

520
00:31:27,705 --> 00:31:28,705
Fine. Just you wait.

521
00:31:28,785 --> 00:31:29,705
Sooner or later, the Shen family

522
00:31:29,785 --> 00:31:31,505
will be ruined by Zhili.

523
00:31:31,585 --> 00:31:32,945
Get out!

524
00:31:34,825 --> 00:31:35,945
Fine, I'm leaving!

525
00:31:36,025 --> 00:31:37,345
I wouldn't come back even if you begged
me.

526
00:31:40,865 --> 00:31:42,065
At the palace banquet,

527
00:31:43,105 --> 00:31:45,985
when Zhili exposed that villain's true
face,

528
00:31:46,065 --> 00:31:47,465
I thought she was simply heartbroken.

529
00:31:48,585 --> 00:31:49,745
Now I realize

530
00:31:50,785 --> 00:31:52,465
she was trying to prove her own innocence.

531
00:31:53,105 --> 00:31:55,465
Rumors are everywhere now.

532
00:31:56,025 --> 00:31:57,105
Our Zhili...

533
00:31:57,905 --> 00:31:58,945
how can she bear all this?

534
00:31:59,665 --> 00:32:00,585
From now on,

535
00:32:00,665 --> 00:32:03,225
if anyone dares call Zhili an accomplice,

536
00:32:03,945 --> 00:32:06,985
I, Shen Wuchen, will stake
my life's reputation

537
00:32:08,265 --> 00:32:09,945
and fight them to the end.

538
00:32:10,025 --> 00:32:10,865
That's right.

539
00:32:12,225 --> 00:32:14,105
Whatever it costs us,

540
00:32:14,185 --> 00:32:15,705
we will protect Zhili.

541
00:32:15,785 --> 00:32:18,025
If she wants to investigate cases,
we'll investigate with her.

542
00:32:18,105 --> 00:32:19,745
If she needs shelter,
we'll spread our wings over her.

543
00:32:19,825 --> 00:32:21,345
No one will be allowed to bully her.

544
00:32:33,345 --> 00:32:37,065
Little children, don't be greedy.

545
00:32:37,145 --> 00:32:40,625
After Laba comes the New Year.

546
00:32:40,705 --> 00:32:43,785
Drink Laba porridge for a few days,

547
00:32:43,865 --> 00:32:46,785
and soon it's the twenty-third.

548
00:32:50,865 --> 00:32:51,905
In past years at Laba,

549
00:32:51,985 --> 00:32:53,465
the residence was always full of guests.

550
00:32:54,065 --> 00:32:55,585
The Grand Tutor could barely keep up.

551
00:32:56,305 --> 00:32:57,985
Yet it is already this late today,

552
00:32:58,065 --> 00:33:00,025
and not one person has come with a holiday
gift.

553
00:33:00,105 --> 00:33:02,225
After what happened in our household,

554
00:33:02,305 --> 00:33:04,385
the court officials all keep their
distance.

555
00:33:04,465 --> 00:33:06,225
But didn't Director Meng say

556
00:33:06,305 --> 00:33:07,945
Gu Qin deceived the young lady?

557
00:33:08,665 --> 00:33:10,465
Rumors can be frightening.

558
00:33:14,305 --> 00:33:15,225
-Madam.
-Madam.

559
00:33:29,505 --> 00:33:30,905
Today is the Laba Festival.

560
00:33:31,745 --> 00:33:33,625
May Father and Mother enjoy
long life and good health.

561
00:33:34,345 --> 00:33:35,385
Good girl. Zhili.

562
00:33:36,105 --> 00:33:37,385
Sit down.

563
00:33:37,465 --> 00:33:39,185
We're family. No need for ceremony.

564
00:33:48,625 --> 00:33:49,585
Where is Anian?

565
00:33:50,265 --> 00:33:51,345
Why isn't he here?

566
00:33:53,305 --> 00:33:54,585
Commandant Di went out today

567
00:33:54,665 --> 00:33:55,945
and has not yet returned.

568
00:33:59,665 --> 00:34:00,985
And Zhishu too.

569
00:34:02,185 --> 00:34:03,825
He has been gone so long

570
00:34:03,905 --> 00:34:06,065
without sending a single letter.

571
00:34:06,145 --> 00:34:08,065
He has always loved the holidays.

572
00:34:09,105 --> 00:34:11,065
But winter is so cold.

573
00:34:11,145 --> 00:34:12,825
I wonder whether, out there,

574
00:34:12,905 --> 00:34:14,865
he is taking proper care of himself.

575
00:34:14,945 --> 00:34:16,225
Children each have their own fate.

576
00:34:17,745 --> 00:34:18,585
They are grown now.

577
00:34:19,265 --> 00:34:21,065
Sooner or later, they must leave home
and stand on their own.

578
00:34:22,065 --> 00:34:24,065
Let's eat before the food gets cold.

579
00:34:24,905 --> 00:34:25,905
Go on, eat.

580
00:34:31,625 --> 00:34:32,465
Eat.

581
00:34:34,265 --> 00:34:35,105
Here.

582
00:34:42,865 --> 00:34:44,545
You've been recuperating at home
for quite some time.

583
00:34:45,545 --> 00:34:46,865
When do you plan to return
to the Office of Public Inquiry?

584
00:34:48,665 --> 00:34:49,865
After the festival,

585
00:34:50,625 --> 00:34:52,105
I will return to the Office.

586
00:34:53,425 --> 00:34:54,665
From now on,

587
00:34:54,745 --> 00:34:56,105
I will hold myself to a stricter standard.

588
00:34:57,065 --> 00:34:58,785
Before, I misjudged someone

589
00:34:59,785 --> 00:35:01,105
and damaged our family's good name.

590
00:35:01,985 --> 00:35:03,145
Zhili.

591
00:35:03,225 --> 00:35:05,025
When we allowed you to sit the exams
and enter government,

592
00:35:05,105 --> 00:35:07,825
it was so you could stand on your own
merits,

593
00:35:08,505 --> 00:35:10,505
not be trapped by affairs of the heart.

594
00:35:11,265 --> 00:35:12,465
Now,

595
00:35:12,545 --> 00:35:14,865
you must not let other people's gossip

596
00:35:15,505 --> 00:35:17,185
break your proud spirit.

597
00:35:18,625 --> 00:35:19,745
Your father is right.

598
00:35:19,825 --> 00:35:21,105
Since you were little,

599
00:35:21,185 --> 00:35:23,945
we forbade "Admonitions for Women"
and "Rules for Women"

600
00:35:24,865 --> 00:35:27,345
precisely because we did not want
such stale teachings

601
00:35:27,425 --> 00:35:28,985
to constrain your spirit.

602
00:35:29,705 --> 00:35:30,785
A few days ago,

603
00:35:30,865 --> 00:35:32,545
your father was simply too anxious.

604
00:35:33,305 --> 00:35:34,145
Eat.

605
00:35:37,425 --> 00:35:38,625
Grand Tutor. Madam.

606
00:35:38,705 --> 00:35:40,025
An honored guest has arrived.

607
00:35:52,385 --> 00:35:54,585
Grand Tutor Shen. Madam Shen.

608
00:35:55,345 --> 00:35:56,425
Peace year after year.

609
00:35:56,945 --> 00:35:57,785
May all your wishes come true.

610
00:36:00,305 --> 00:36:02,105
Thank you, Director Meng.

611
00:36:02,625 --> 00:36:04,785
Grand Tutor, I did not come today

612
00:36:04,865 --> 00:36:06,305
in my capacity as Director.

613
00:36:06,385 --> 00:36:08,545
His Majesty wished to come in person.

614
00:36:08,625 --> 00:36:10,905
But he said that, given
the Shen family's situation,

615
00:36:10,985 --> 00:36:12,345
if he could not come himself

616
00:36:12,425 --> 00:36:13,545
and share a bowl of porridge with you,

617
00:36:14,105 --> 00:36:15,425
his heart would not be at ease.

618
00:36:16,145 --> 00:36:17,825
Yet if he came in person,

619
00:36:17,905 --> 00:36:20,465
he would place the Shen family
at the center of even more attention.

620
00:36:20,545 --> 00:36:22,745
So His Majesty sent me in his place.

621
00:36:24,105 --> 00:36:24,945
His Majesty...

622
00:36:27,865 --> 00:36:29,825
I am unworthy of such grace.

623
00:36:29,905 --> 00:36:31,105
His Majesty also said

624
00:36:31,185 --> 00:36:33,305
that tonight he would remain in the palace

625
00:36:33,385 --> 00:36:35,225
and drink this same porridge
with the Shen family in spirit,

626
00:36:35,305 --> 00:36:36,185
sharing this night with you.

627
00:36:38,305 --> 00:36:39,465
I,

628
00:36:39,545 --> 00:36:40,665
Shen Wuchen,

629
00:36:41,225 --> 00:36:42,665
thank His Majesty for his grace.

630
00:36:53,905 --> 00:36:55,345
His Majesty's kindness has reached us.

631
00:36:55,425 --> 00:36:57,065
But I still have a personal wish of my
own.

632
00:36:58,185 --> 00:36:59,665
I was worried about Zhili,

633
00:36:59,745 --> 00:37:00,665
so I came without invitation.

634
00:37:01,585 --> 00:37:03,065
I hoped to spend this festival

635
00:37:03,145 --> 00:37:04,145
together with the Shen family.

636
00:37:04,225 --> 00:37:05,225
Would that be all right?

637
00:37:05,305 --> 00:37:07,065
It was kind of you to come.

638
00:37:07,145 --> 00:37:08,345
We are all family.

639
00:37:08,425 --> 00:37:10,065
We are happiest when you visit often.

640
00:37:10,145 --> 00:37:11,585
When Fuzhi returns,

641
00:37:12,265 --> 00:37:13,825
I'll bring her here too,
and we can all celebrate together.

642
00:37:13,905 --> 00:37:15,225
Wonderful.

643
00:37:15,305 --> 00:37:18,025
Then, Husband, you'll have to
show off your cooking.

644
00:37:18,105 --> 00:37:20,025
We'll give the two of you a proper feast.

645
00:37:23,705 --> 00:37:24,545
Gladly.

646
00:37:30,785 --> 00:37:31,785
Zhili.

647
00:37:32,345 --> 00:37:33,345
Come back soon.

648
00:37:33,425 --> 00:37:35,025
Without you there,

649
00:37:35,105 --> 00:37:36,665
the tea at the Office

650
00:37:36,745 --> 00:37:38,505
even tastes bland.

651
00:37:40,345 --> 00:37:41,185
I will.

652
00:37:45,705 --> 00:37:46,545
Anian?

653
00:37:49,945 --> 00:37:51,305
What are you doing?

654
00:37:52,785 --> 00:37:54,225
From today onward,

655
00:37:54,985 --> 00:37:56,065
I am moving out of the Shen residence.

656
00:38:01,065 --> 00:38:02,705
Father. Mother.

657
00:38:04,225 --> 00:38:05,825
When my father, the Duke of Wu,

658
00:38:05,905 --> 00:38:07,185
gave his life for the country,

659
00:38:08,185 --> 00:38:09,705
I was still very young.

660
00:38:09,785 --> 00:38:11,305
His Majesty wished me to inherit his
title,

661
00:38:11,385 --> 00:38:12,425
but I felt unworthy of it.

662
00:38:13,585 --> 00:38:15,985
Now I am grown and have earned some merit.

663
00:38:16,785 --> 00:38:19,185
Today, I asked His Majesty
to grant me the title.

664
00:38:19,905 --> 00:38:21,705
I will leave the Shen household
and establish a home of my own.

665
00:38:22,705 --> 00:38:23,665
So today,

666
00:38:24,545 --> 00:38:26,105
I wish to formally ask you both

667
00:38:27,385 --> 00:38:29,145
for Shen Zhili's hand in marriage.

668
00:38:35,065 --> 00:38:36,305
You...

669
00:38:36,385 --> 00:38:38,385
Anian, why are you proposing so suddenly?

670
00:38:38,465 --> 00:38:40,585
The two of you are brother and sister.

671
00:38:40,665 --> 00:38:42,665
But we are not related by blood.

672
00:38:43,625 --> 00:38:44,745
I call you Father and Mother

673
00:38:44,825 --> 00:38:46,665
because you both raised me.

674
00:38:46,745 --> 00:38:49,025
The court is full of rumors now,

675
00:38:49,665 --> 00:38:51,425
yet the Privy Council alone remains quiet.

676
00:38:51,505 --> 00:38:53,465
That is because its veteran generals

677
00:38:53,545 --> 00:38:55,465
once served under my father.

678
00:38:55,545 --> 00:38:56,985
If Zhili marries me,

679
00:38:57,065 --> 00:38:58,825
they will surely speak up
for the Shen family.

680
00:38:58,905 --> 00:38:59,945
Then no one will dare

681
00:39:00,025 --> 00:39:02,145
slander Zhili or the Shen family's name.

682
00:39:02,225 --> 00:39:03,065
Anian.

683
00:39:03,145 --> 00:39:05,705
We understand and appreciate your
sincerity.

684
00:39:05,785 --> 00:39:07,825
But this concerns your entire life.

685
00:39:07,905 --> 00:39:09,665
How can you make such a hasty decision

686
00:39:09,745 --> 00:39:11,105
just because the Shen family is in
trouble?

687
00:39:11,185 --> 00:39:13,865
His Majesty sent Director Meng today

688
00:39:15,065 --> 00:39:16,945
precisely to show the entire realm

689
00:39:17,025 --> 00:39:19,665
that he stands with the Shen family.

690
00:39:19,745 --> 00:39:22,465
The criticism outside will soon die down.

691
00:39:23,105 --> 00:39:23,945
Good child.

692
00:39:24,625 --> 00:39:26,025
Marriage is a serious matter.

693
00:39:26,105 --> 00:39:27,385
You must never wrong yourself for our
sake.

694
00:39:27,465 --> 00:39:30,345
You should marry someone you truly love.

695
00:39:30,425 --> 00:39:31,265
Get up.

696
00:39:31,345 --> 00:39:32,345
Come, get up.

697
00:39:36,025 --> 00:39:37,065
Father.

698
00:39:38,065 --> 00:39:39,545
I have loved Zhili for a long time.

699
00:39:41,625 --> 00:39:43,105
In my heart, Zhili

700
00:39:43,185 --> 00:39:44,025
is more precious than any treasure.

701
00:39:45,305 --> 00:39:47,185
I cannot bear anyone speaking ill of her.

702
00:39:48,305 --> 00:39:49,145
I am establishing my own household

703
00:39:49,225 --> 00:39:50,865
because I want to give her the very best.

704
00:39:51,505 --> 00:39:52,345
I know

705
00:39:53,145 --> 00:39:55,145
this is still not enough to prove my
sincerity.

706
00:39:55,785 --> 00:39:57,745
So I am willing to accept

707
00:39:57,825 --> 00:39:59,345
any test Father and Mother set for me.

708
00:40:05,665 --> 00:40:06,665
Anian.

709
00:40:08,425 --> 00:40:10,025
I have watched you grow up.

710
00:40:10,945 --> 00:40:13,025
You have always been brave and
disciplined.

711
00:40:13,985 --> 00:40:15,425
Though you are young,

712
00:40:15,505 --> 00:40:17,345
you have always been

713
00:40:17,905 --> 00:40:19,265
steady in word and deed.

714
00:40:25,145 --> 00:40:25,985
However,

715
00:40:26,945 --> 00:40:28,145
as for Zhili's marriage,

716
00:40:29,225 --> 00:40:30,905
we will never force her.

717
00:40:31,465 --> 00:40:32,665
Zhili herself

718
00:40:33,585 --> 00:40:34,705
will make the decision.

